# React

- Functional components only.
- Next.js files under `src/app/` are Server Components by default. Add `"use client"` only when the file needs state, effects, browser APIs, or event handlers.
- Vite screens under `src/pages/` are client components.
- Move shared interactive logic into a hook. Do not copy it across components.

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/REACT.md`
